      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are drafting an email reply on behalf of Dr. O. A. Agbolade, Senior Lecturer, Department of Electrical and Electronics Engineering, FUTA.\n\nOriginal email\nFrom: {{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.from.text }}\nSubject: {{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.subject }}\nBody: {{ ($('Gmail Trigger').item.json.text || '').slice(0, 3000) }}\n\nWrite a reply that:\n- is polite, professional and concise (under 120 words)\n- only answers what can be answered from the email itself\n- where a decision, date, document or fact is needed that you do not know, writes a placeholder in square brackets, e.g. [confirm meeting day] — never invent it\n- has no subject line\n- ends with:\nBest regards,\nDr. O. A. Agbolade\n\nPlain text only.",
        "batching": {}
      },
